# WARFORZLANDS – ECONOMY CONFIGURATION V1

**Temporary balancing exchange rate:**  
**1 Gold = 1,000 FT**

> This rate is only for internal balancing. The live Gold ↔ FT market ratio can become dynamic later.

---

